{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57187","headline":"十二时颂 七 · 宝志","name":"十二时颂 七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晡时申，学道先须不厌贫。\n有相本来权积聚，无形何用要安真。\n作净洁，却劳神，莫认愚痴作近邻。\n言下不求无处所，暂时唤作出家人。\n（《宗镜录》卷二四引末二句）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宝志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_57187.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57187","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}